# Student Management System

A web-based Student Management System built to organize student information and academic activities.

## Features
- Admin and student login
- Student record management
- Attendance management
- Results management
- Course management
- Student dashboard

## Technologies
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Node.js
- Express.js
- SQLite

## Setup
1. Install Node.js.
2. Run `npm install`.
3. Start the backend using the start command configured in `package.json`.